            <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.4.1</h3>
<ul>
<li>Updated Eridani image assets and fixed zlib issue</li>
<li>New webview display tool for showing local HTML files</li>
<li>Improved settings views; added pre-Tahoe warning for web search</li>
<li>Embedded Lightpanda container support</li>
<li>xAI API support and OpenCode support; models pulled from API</li>
<li>Scheduled agents capability</li>
<li>Support for locally running external MCPs</li>
<li>Beta feature gates and subscription/update test prep</li>
</ul>]]></description>
